        "answer": {
          "short": "$2200\\text{ cm}^2$",
          "worked": "There are three pairs of equal rectangular faces.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}S&=2(30\\times20)+2(30\\times10)+2(20\\times10)\\\\S&=1200+600+400\\\\S&=2200\\text{ cm}^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
